{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e10-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不管什么处境都要做最好的自己  (Being Your Best Self in Any Situation)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Walking along the waterfront after her surprise birthday gathering, Bu Xiaogu asks her well-connected admirer whether Xin Huimei can lend a hand to Xingtian's show revamp and explains the approach to life she truly respects. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你，你这说的哪儿的话啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有，我是从来没有办过这么热闹的生日聚会，给我吓懵了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱们算是朋友吧？那你是要干吗啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "就是工作上的事，希望辛惠美能帮一下忙，你能说上话吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？什么问题啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这种生活态度，我不是很欣赏。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我欣赏的生活态度，就是不管你身处在什么处境，你都要做最好的自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果你是个穷人的话，你会让自己生活得更好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果你是个富人的话，你会让自己变得更好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他把自己股份的百分之九十九全捐出来了，研究人类的潜能开发了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我叫车了，很快就来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你，今儿晚上很开心。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你，你这说的哪儿的话啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you — don't talk like it was any trouble at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没有，我是从来没有办过这么热闹的生日聚会，给我吓懵了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not at all; I've simply never had such a lively birthday party before, so it stunned me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱们算是朋友吧？那你是要干吗啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We count as friends, don't we? Then what are you trying to do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "就是工作上的事，希望辛惠美能帮一下忙，你能说上话吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's about work — I'm hoping Xin Huimei might help us out; can you put in a word?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？什么问题啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Really? What question do you want to ask me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这种生活态度，我不是很欣赏。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To be honest, I don't really admire that kind of attitude toward life.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我欣赏的生活态度，就是不管你身处在什么处境，你都要做最好的自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The life attitude I admire is striving to be your very best self, no matter what circumstances you are in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果你是个穷人的话，你会让自己生活得更好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you are poor, you work hard to give yourself a better life.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果你是个富人的话，你会让自己变得更好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And if you are wealthy, you push yourself to become a better person.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他把自己股份的百分之九十九全捐出来了，研究人类的潜能开发了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He donated ninety-nine percent of his own shares to research unlocking human potential.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我叫车了，很快就来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I already called a car; it will be here very soon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你，今儿晚上很开心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you — I had a really happy evening tonight.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢你，你这说的哪儿的话啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
